          "explanation": "The doctor requests the full urine culture and sensitivity report, and distinguishes between urine abnormal, culture positive, and symptomatic infection.",
          "quote": "把目前所有药名和剂量、最近肌酐/eGFR、尿常规及培养结果（出来后）逐字发来"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00079",
          "explanation": "The doctor reiterates the requirement to obtain the full culture report and explains the difference between culture positivity and UTI.",
          "quote": "正式报告出来后请逐行发来：菌名、菌落计数、药敏“敏感/耐药”结果；同时补充尿常规、肌酐/eGFR及全部药名剂量"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently requested and verified the complete urine culture report, including organism, colony count, and susceptibility, and distinguished between different types of urinary test abnormalities.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
